    <string name="crowns_howto_goal_title">The goal</string>
    <string name="crowns_howto_goal_body">Place one crown in every row, every column and every colour region.\n\nTwo crowns may never touch, not even diagonally.</string>
    <string name="crowns_howto_marks_title">Marking cells</string>
    <string name="crowns_howto_marks_body">Tap a cell to cross it out (✕). Double-tap to place a crown.\n\nSwipe from an empty cell to cross out several cells at once.\n\nThe ✕/? button makes taps and swipes write ? instead, for cells you are unsure about. Tap a mark to remove it.</string>
    <string name="crowns_howto_erase_title">Erasing</string>
    <string name="crowns_howto_erase_body">Swipe from a ✕ or ? to erase the marks you pass over. Crowns stay.\n\nThe broom (Clear marks) removes every ✕ and ? and keeps your crowns. The bin (Clear all) empties the whole grid.\n\nUndo reverts your last action.</string>
    <string name="crowns_howto_modes_title">Classic or Hardcore</string>
    <string name="crowns_howto_modes_body">Classic: crowns that break a rule are highlighted. A crown in the wrong place turns red and uses one hint, while hints last. The game ends by itself once solved.\n\nHardcore: no help at all. Once every crown is placed, press Check.</string>
